<title>UK: Fokus Bank sets 250 mln mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Fokus Bank sets 250 mln mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FOKUS BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    19.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    19.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     ISSUE	100.011   REOFFER     100.011</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMANY   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**US/UK/DE/NORWAY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
